production + localhost:3000), yeu cau tu mo trinh duyet that de test sau khi fix.

=== BUG THAT DA SUA (code defect, verify qua Playwright that) ===

1. Dropdown menu "trong suot": ul.dropdown-menu:not(.level1) (assets/global_core.scss.bwt dong
