   0.0015 (gan nhu vo hinh). Sua thanh 0.15 (dung), them border 1px nhe. Verify: click that vao
   "DIEU TRI CHUYEN NGHIEP", dropdown gio hien ro card trang co shadow/border tach biet khoi
   hero image ben duoi (truoc: hoa lan vao nen, sau: card ro rang).
   LUU Y: cung tim thay 2 cho khac co CUNG loi go he thong (rgba(...,0.04%)) o
   assets/comp_quickview_cart.scss.bwt + assets/page_product.scss.bwt (nut mui ten carousel) -
   da sua ca 2 luon (cung 1 loai bug, an toan/tam thuong de sua).

2. "Hover-out" dropdown khong dong: DA KIEM TRA KY - day KHONG PHAI bug. Test lai voi diem chuot
